{"4708440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prestige Electric Company", "steam_appid": 4708440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Welcome to<strong> Prestige Electric Company.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We're excited to onboard you into the company, here's what to expect </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">from day to day operations running our state of the art power plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/3ebd8ecb3c995f8a0c0810de7ecc663f.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/3ebd8ecb3c995f8a0c0810de7ecc663f.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>You're The Manager</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take control of the plant. You're in charge of everything from the finances, deliveries of coal and supplies, repairing equipment, and making sure our customers have uninterrupted power service. None of the experienced plant managers accepted our job offer, so don't mess this up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/0b37701233f8d7d5f3dc4c4a83fe9f2f.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/0b37701233f8d7d5f3dc4c4a83fe9f2f.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Maintain The Plant</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All the equipment needs maintenance, everything from the boilers, to the turbines, pipes, and electrical equipment. Letting things degrade results in reduced outputs and dangerous working conditions, so try to keep everything running smooth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/f6178559e62e98456b7c8e4ce1ff9376.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/f6178559e62e98456b7c8e4ce1ff9376.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Build Your Control Room</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every plant needs a proper control room to run smooth. Unfortunately a significant amount of upfront construction costs were used for &quot;business trips&quot; so only a shell of a control room is provided. You'll need to build up your control consoles to the most efficient workflow for you, using plug and play dials, gauges, buttons, switches, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/876d2393bad814c4f72ac15998ac36fe.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/876d2393bad814c4f72ac15998ac36fe.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Gear Up</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the end of each day, you'll have the opportunity to visit a hardware store to purchase vital equipment to keep the plant running. You'll have access to new and better tools, improved control room modules, and more. Just don't think you'll be able to use company funds. These are non approved purchases, so you'll have to use your daily paycheck if you want to make your life easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/1c618e42cd6ae143922d5e2ee2915878.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/1c618e42cd6ae143922d5e2ee2915878.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Upgrade <i>Everything</i></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your whole plant can be improved, mostly because Prestige cheaped out on the design costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boilers can be improved to output more heat, withstand more damage, and output more useful data.<br>Steam Turbines will become more efficient, intake more steam, and release more mechanical energy.<br>Pipes can have increased capacity, Trains can carry more coal, Cooling towers can save on water costs,<br>and much, much more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/0a9b730289d3e326e2a8540e3b871a3a.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/0a9b730289d3e326e2a8540e3b871a3a.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=855 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Welcome to<strong> Prestige Electric Company.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We're excited to onboard you into the company, here's what to expect </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">from day to day operations running our state of the art power plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/3ebd8ecb3c995f8a0c0810de7ecc663f.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/3ebd8ecb3c995f8a0c0810de7ecc663f.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>You're The Manager</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take control of the plant. You're in charge of everything from the finances, deliveries of coal and supplies, repairing equipment, and making sure our customers have uninterrupted power service. None of the experienced plant managers accepted our job offer, so don't mess this up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/0b37701233f8d7d5f3dc4c4a83fe9f2f.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/0b37701233f8d7d5f3dc4c4a83fe9f2f.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Maintain The Plant</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All the equipment needs maintenance, everything from the boilers, to the turbines, pipes, and electrical equipment. Letting things degrade results in reduced outputs and dangerous working conditions, so try to keep everything running smooth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/f6178559e62e98456b7c8e4ce1ff9376.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/f6178559e62e98456b7c8e4ce1ff9376.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Build Your Control Room</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every plant needs a proper control room to run smooth. Unfortunately a significant amount of upfront construction costs were used for &quot;business trips&quot; so only a shell of a control room is provided. You'll need to build up your control consoles to the most efficient workflow for you, using plug and play dials, gauges, buttons, switches, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/876d2393bad814c4f72ac15998ac36fe.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/876d2393bad814c4f72ac15998ac36fe.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Gear Up</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the end of each day, you'll have the opportunity to visit a hardware store to purchase vital equipment to keep the plant running. You'll have access to new and better tools, improved control room modules, and more. Just don't think you'll be able to use company funds. These are non approved purchases, so you'll have to use your daily paycheck if you want to make your life easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/1c618e42cd6ae143922d5e2ee2915878.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/1c618e42cd6ae143922d5e2ee2915878.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Upgrade <i>Everything</i></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your whole plant can be improved, mostly because Prestige cheaped out on the design costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boilers can be improved to output more heat, withstand more damage, and output more useful data.<br>Steam Turbines will become more efficient, intake more steam, and release more mechanical energy.<br>Pipes can have increased capacity, Trains can carry more coal, Cooling towers can save on water costs,<br>and much, much more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras/0a9b730289d3e326e2a8540e3b871a3a.avif?t=1781022255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/extras_big/0a9b730289d3e326e2a8540e3b871a3a.webp?t=1781022255 width=1560 height=855 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Prestige Electric has put you in charge of the groundbreaking of their new coal power plant. Build up your control room, maintain the integrity of the plant, and try not to jump into the turbine blades, they're expensive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/62de925c87ad7d2a7a67d800cc3fa8df55dbad98/header.jpg?t=1781022255", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/8ca5ec58a29d9fa0afbe1bc43f7ddd68d5960d69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781022255", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708440/8ca5ec58a29d9fa0afbe1bc43f7ddd68d596